 Durumu ve Fikst\u00fcr","url":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/futbol\/tff-1-lig-puan-durumu-ve-fikstur","@id":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/futbol\/tff-1-lig-puan-durumu-ve-fikstur"}]}</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/guncel","name":"G\u00fcncel"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/amasyanin-gizli-cenneti-yedikugular-kus-cenneti","name":"Amasya'n\u0131n gizli cenneti: Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Amasya'n\u0131n gizli cenneti: Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti","articleSection":"G\u00fcncel","dateCreated":"2023-06-15T01:45:00+03:00","datePublished":"2023-06-15T01:45:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-04-15T12:32:26+03:00","wordCount":281,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/amasyanin-gizli-cenneti-yedikugular-kus-cenneti"},"articleBody":"Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti, Amasya\u2019n\u0131n Suluova il\u00e7esinde bulunuyor ve ad\u0131n\u0131, efsanelere konu olan yedi ku\u011fudan al\u0131yor. Yedi Ku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti, T\u00fcrkiye'nin en \u00f6nemli ku\u015f alanlar\u0131ndan biri olup, ku\u015f g\u00f6zlemcili\u011fi listesinde 57. s\u0131rada yer al\u0131yor.\r\n\r\nB\u00f6lge, 817 hektarl\u0131k geni\u015f bir alana yay\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olup, 1989 y\u0131l\u0131nda S\u0130T alan\u0131 olarak ilan edilmi\u015f. Do\u011fa severler i\u00e7in vazge\u00e7ilmez bir destinasyon olan bu cennet, turistlere ku\u015flar\u0131n sesleri e\u015fli\u011finde huzur dolu bir ortam sunuyor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u00d6zellikle g\u00f6\u00e7 d\u00f6nemlerinde bir\u00e7ok ku\u015f t\u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn u\u011frak noktas\u0131 olan Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti, ayn\u0131 zamanda nadir bulunan akpelikanlar\u0131n T\u00fcrkiye\u2019deki iki \u00fcreme alan\u0131ndan birine de ev sahipli\u011fi yap\u0131yor.\r\n\r\nYediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti, Yedik\u0131r Baraj\u0131 \u00fczerinde yer al\u0131yor. 600 hektarl\u0131k alana yay\u0131lan baraj g\u00f6l\u00fc, Tersakan \u00c7ay\u0131\u2019ndan besleniyor ve b\u00f6lge, ayn\u0131 zamanda sulama ama\u00e7l\u0131 kullan\u0131l\u0131yor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDo\u011faseverlerin en \u00e7ok tercih etti\u011fi aktivitelerden biri olan kamp\u00e7\u0131l\u0131k i\u00e7in de olduk\u00e7a uygun bir yer olan Yediku\u011fular, son zamanlarda millet bah\u00e7esi stat\u00fcs\u00fcne kavu\u015fmu\u015f ve giri\u015f \u00fccretleri kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\nAyn\u0131 zamanda DS\u0130 taraf\u0131ndan baraj g\u00f6l\u00fc \u00fczerinde kurulan bal\u0131k \u00e7iftli\u011fi sayesinde, olta bal\u0131k\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 merakl\u0131lar\u0131 i\u00e7in de keyifli bir deneyim sunuluyor. Bu b\u00f6lgede yeti\u015ftirilen bal\u0131klar, do\u011fal ya\u015fam\u0131 desteklemek ad\u0131na g\u00f6le b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131yor.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 olduk\u00e7a kolay olan Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti, kolay ula\u015f\u0131m\u0131 ve sundu\u011fu do\u011fal g\u00fczelliklerle Amasya'n\u0131n sakl\u0131 cennetlerinden biri olmay\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fcyor.","description":"Amasya, tarihi ve do\u011fal g\u00fczelliklerinin yan\u0131 s\u0131ra, e\u015fsiz bir ku\u015f cennetine de ev sahipli\u011fi yap\u0131yor: Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti. 100'den fazla ku\u015f t\u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fc a\u011f\u0131rlayan bu do\u011fa harikas\u0131, ku\u015f g\u00f6zlemcileri ve do\u011faseverler i\u00e7in ideal bir destinasyon.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yaylahabercomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/yaylahaber-com-tr\/uploads\/2023\/06\/yedikugularkuscenneti.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Amasya'n\u0131n gizli cenneti: Yediku\u011fular Ku\u015f Cenneti"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/gizlilik-sozlesmesi","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yayla Haber","image":"https:\/\/yaylahabercomtr.teimg.com\/yaylahaber-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/01\/yayla-haber-logo-light-2.svg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yaylahabercomtr.teimg.com\/yaylahaber-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/01\/yayla-haber-logo-light-2.svg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Naci Ayg\u00fcn","jobTitle":"Muhabir","url":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/muhabir\/22\/naci-aygun"},"creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yayla Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr"},"license":"https:\/\/www.yaylahaber.com.tr\/gizlilik-sozlesmesi"}</script>


